    <ns0:title>v1.2.24-vscode</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Stable release of the Continue VS Code extension (final release): removes the CLI-install banner and Generate Rule feature, switches onboarding and the new-config template to explicit model definitions (no Hub slugs), and updates the deprecation banner export link. Re-cut of v1.2.23 which only partially published due to a transient Marketplace API timeout.&lt;/p&gt;</ns0:content>
